WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:07.380
what do you think i want to achieve with this study um i think

00:07.380 --> 00:19.300
okay i felt like the final uh act where the um reveal was with the water and the robot i felt

00:19.300 --> 00:27.080
that was a small political kind of statement about how a artificial intelligence is like

00:27.080 --> 00:36.720
harming the environment a lot and i feel you were exploring how people in general interact with

00:36.720 --> 00:42.360
well chatbots and ai agents and how this might

00:42.360 --> 00:50.260
um how the game environment might influence their motivation talking to it

00:50.260 --> 00:54.460
what do you think of your llm companion in the kitchen

00:54.460 --> 00:56.380
um

00:56.380 --> 00:57.060
i think

00:57.060 --> 01:06.760
it was quite fun uh it felt a little sassy at times which i actually liked it felt more

01:06.760 --> 01:17.480
alive and personal in that way other than that i think it was well normal in a way that's like

01:17.480 --> 01:22.140
how i imagine how i imagine a cat would probably view ingredients too

01:24.060 --> 01:26.720
did you like using blocks to convey your insights

01:27.060 --> 01:33.100
to solve the puzzle?

01:33.100 --> 01:40.060
I'm not sure what alternative there could be, but I think the system was implemented

01:40.060 --> 01:47.020
in a way it was easy to use.

01:47.020 --> 01:51.300
Did you like using the text chat to explain why the LLM behaved odd?

01:51.300 --> 01:54.820
Oh, now I get what you're comparing.

01:54.820 --> 02:01.540
Actually, I think I did like typing my own answers better, yeah.

02:01.540 --> 02:03.600
Are you satisfied in your work with the chatbot?

02:03.600 --> 02:06.300
Why or why not?

02:06.300 --> 02:11.320
I feel satisfied, I think.

02:11.320 --> 02:19.860
I feel I got more mistakes and oddities in the first part, but I felt like I was really

02:19.860 --> 02:23.940
immersed in the conversation for the second part.

02:23.940 --> 02:24.780
Yeah.

02:24.780 --> 02:26.500
I like both a lot.

